{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "AdVantage Compatibility Analyzer",
  "description": "Monitors AdVantage project files for critical compatibility issues and provides automated fixes for TypeScript errors, missing dependencies, and architectural improvements based on the detailed compatibility analysis report",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "AdVantage/src/**/*.ts",
      "AdVantage/src/**/*.tsx",
      "AdVantage/package.json",
      "AdVantage/tsconfig.json",
      "AdVantage/App.tsx"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Analyze the changed files in the AdVantage project and provide specific fixes for:\n\n1. **Critical TypeScript Errors** \n2. **Missing Dependencies** - Install and configure missing packages:\n3. **Architecture Improvements** - Add missing folder structures: \n4. **State Management** - Implement Zustand stores and React Query setup\n5. **Design System** \n6. **AI Service Integration** - \n7. **Testing Framework** - Add React Native Testing Library and Detox setup\n\nFocus on the highest priority issues first (CRITICAL level) and provide concrete implementation steps. The project needs to be production-ready and error-free."
  }
}